her types of resource <em class="rfc">may</em> have the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">provider</code> property with at least one item. <br />
Clients <em class="rfc">should</em> render <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">provider</code> on other types of resource.</li>
</ul>

